      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berino%2C_New_Mexico"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Berino’s long‑standing irrigation has moved from alfalfa ranches to dairy in the early 20th century, and today hemp is a growing crop.",
